title: Sources
author: Thom Bruce

# Shared Sources

A references file: other files in the project cite these sources with `[@key]`,
and — because citations resolve across the whole project — the author-date form
prints and the source lands in the citing file's bibliography, even though it is
defined here.

% References

%% Strunk & White
id: strunk-white-2000
author: Strunk, W. and White, E. B.
year: 2000
title: The Elements of Style
edition: 4th
place: New York
publisher: Longman

A secondary source kept apart from the prose that cites it.
